{"parse": {"title": "小狗与流浪汉-01", "pageid": 89608, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%9A%AE%E5%85%8B%E5%8B%92%E6%96%AF%C2%B7%E5%B0%8F%E7%8B%97%E4%B8%8E%E6%B5%81%E6%B5%AA%E6%B1%89\" title=\"皮克勒斯·小狗与流浪汉\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">小狗与流浪汉-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E7%8B%97%E4%B8%8E%E6%B5%81%E6%B5%AA%E6%B1%89-02\" title=\"小狗与流浪汉-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">小狗与流浪汉</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.9B.9B.E6.83.85.E6.9D.A5.E7.94.B5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"盛情来电\">盛情来电</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 盛情来电</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Warm Call</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-chaerdunjia.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"chaerdunjia\"><img alt=\"chaerdunjia\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/Cg-chaerdunjia.png/600px-Cg-chaerdunjia.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/Cg-chaerdunjia.png/900px-Cg-chaerdunjia.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/Cg-chaerdunjia.png/1200px-Cg-chaerdunjia.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>……是的，当然，我完全能明白您有多喜欢小皮克勒斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人手忙脚乱地摆弄着手中那个密封性极强的配方罐头，一边努力地试图用肩膀与耳朵夹住那个即将滑落的座机听筒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>罐头新包装上，边境牧羊犬的笑容勉强。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>但您要知道，作为他的挚友，我始终把他放在最重要的位置……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>所以在这方面，我更希望尊重他的个犬意愿……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温迪：</div><div>汪汪？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>呜，汪汪。<i>&lt;抱歉，温迪。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪，汪。<i>&lt;关于你的抛接球时光严重缩水的问题，我需要承担大部分责任。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>皮克勒斯安抚性地伏下身来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>呜呜。<i>&lt;毕竟查尔顿几乎一天都在接这些电话。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温迪：</div><div>汪，汪汪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>獒，汪汪汪。<i>&lt;是，他们确实也是那些怪味配方罐头的始作俑者。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>呜，汪汪？<i>&lt;说到底，究竟为什么有人决定要在狗罐罐里面加海鲈鱼呢？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>温迪表示赞同，它无奈似的从鼻孔里长出了一口气，也低头趴了下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两只小狗趴作一排，直勾勾地盯着那个正在冲听筒抒发他爱犬情结的男人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>又有谁不想摸摸他柔顺的皮毛呢？他是我见过最聪明的狗狗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>但他喜欢安静，我的朋友。我两分钟前才回绝了宠物毛刷代言邀请……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>所以，很抱歉，我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>您说什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>哦，等等，前面，不，不是这句，是前面……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黑色的毛绒耳朵立得笔直。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>嗯，汪汪汪。<i>&lt;这个表情，我想我有些熟悉。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪……<i>&lt;温迪……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小斗牛犬无视了身后的呼唤，衔着最心爱的回弹球出了院子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>哦天哪，法国！真的吗？……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>还有游，游轮……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>哦，没问题，完全没问题……他，一定会喜欢，我敢说一定会——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪。<i>&lt;唉。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>笔直的耳朵缓缓垂了下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺……<i>&lt;或许事到如今……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺。<i>&lt;我不该再感到意外了。&gt;</i></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "小狗与流浪汉-01"}}